{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#card-zh","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 是 Windows 桌面版 DSH 通知插件，会在后台收到审批请求或对话任务完成时弹出系统通知。插件监听审批与会话事件，通过 PowerShell 发送 Windows toast；审批提示可设置铃声和重复提醒，完成通知可单独开关并显示对话标题。DSH 设置页可调整通知、前台静默和点击通知返回窗口等选项，也能测试通知并查看状态。适合切换到其他程序时仍需及时处理 DSH 审批或等待任务结束的 Windows 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:571","lib/index.js:625","lib/index.js:737","lib/client.js:485"]}
{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#card-en","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts sends Windows toasts for DSH approvals and completed tasks. Users can configure sounds and repeats, manage focus behavior, and test alerts from DSH settings. Clicking a toast can return to the app. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:571","lib/index.js:625","lib/index.js:737","lib/client.js:485"]}
