{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#feature-1","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 的功能「审批请求通知」：后台出现需要处理的审批请求时发送 Windows toast，并按设置播放提示音。插件还可在请求未处理时按配置重复提醒，并对短时间内相同工具的请求进行冷却。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:571","lib/index.js:592"]}
{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#feature-2","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 的功能「任务完成通知」：收到已完成的 turn/end 会话事件时发送通知，正文可带对话标题；未完成、子代理会话不会触发此通知。任务完成通知可以独立开关和配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:737","lib/index.js:746","lib/index.js:749"]}
{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#feature-3","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 的功能「通知设置与测试」：DSH 设置页提供审批和完成通知的开关、强度、声音及标题配置，并可立即发送测试通知、查看最近的处理状态。设置通过插件提供的页面接口读取和保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:156","lib/client.js:180","lib/client.js:216","lib/client.js:485"]}
{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#feature-4","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 的功能「点击通知返回 DSH」：点击 toast 后通过 dshalerts 协议唤起处理程序，将 DSH 窗口切回前台；若应用已退出，可按记录的可执行文件路径重新启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/protocol.js:122","lib/protocol.js:126"]}
{"unit_id":"Gusheng-GS__dsh-desktop-alerts#caveat-1","repo":"Gusheng-GS/dsh-desktop-alerts","commit":"88455893ace735f72f583bbe193d94ca32a3eca3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-alerts 使用前须知：系统通知和通知点击返回功能仅在 Windows 启用；非 Windows 环境会停用审批通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44","lib/index.js:775","lib/protocol.js:126"]}
